{"bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20250718\/20250718093555_92974.png","category_id":"6a15761c36fd3b1e17366834","column_id":"6a154fc77093015d5705df9a","create_time":"2025-07-04 09:34:23","details":"<span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#337FE5;\">Proc Natl Acad Sci U S A. 2024 Mar 12;121(11):e2307801120.&nbsp; doi: 10.1073\/pnas.2307801120.&nbsp; Epub 2024 Mar 4.<\/span><br \/>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>Cationic cholesterol-dependent LNP delivery to lung stem cells, the liver, and heart<\/strong><\/span>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>摘要<\/strong><\/span><br \/>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">在脂质纳米颗粒（LNP）中添加阳离子辅助脂质可以增加肺输送和减少肝输送。然而，目前尚不清楚电荷依赖的向性是否普遍存在，或者是否取决于带电的组分。在这里，我们报告的证据表明，阳离子胆固醇依赖的向性可能不同于阳离子辅助脂质依赖的向性。通过测试196个LNPs如何将mRNA传递到22种细胞类型，我们发现带电的胆固醇导致不同的肺：肝传递比带电的辅助脂质。我们还发现，将阳离子胆固醇与阳离子辅助脂质结合可导致mRNA在心脏和几种肺细胞类型（包括干细胞样细胞群）中的传递。这些数据突出了探索电荷相关LNP向性的效用。<\/span><br \/>\r\n<br \/>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">关键词:现况;条码技术;信使rna;纳米颗粒;scRNA-seq。<\/span><br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span background-color:#ffffff;font-size:18px;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; display: block; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei-Regular&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong>想要获取更多关于此类产品信息，请通过以下方式联系我们：<\/strong><\/span><span font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=